docs/workflow/_portable/02-handoff-and-state.md:235:**Machine-gate constraint (optional, project-level):** projects can enforce that any commit modifying the Status Panel's `Status:` or `Suggested Next:` line must carry a precise, case-sensitive trailer (e.g. `Co-authored-by: <status-writing-role> <workflow-v2@local>`), checked by a lint script + CI. `<status-writing-role>` must come from the §2.6 write-authority matrix. This is project infrastructure — see the project layer for the concrete lint/CI wiring.
