docs/workflow/_portable/01-workflow-model.md:569:**Format-compliance checks:** Claude `model` is a full ID, not an alias; Claude review agents (`feature-review` / `feature-verify` / `bug-verify`) `tools` exclude `Write`/`Edit`/`Bash`; Codex review agents `sandbox_mode = "read-only"`; Cursor `model` is `inherit`/`fast`, not `auto`; Cursor review agents have `readonly: true`; Cursor loop agents have `is_background: true`; all platforms' `description` start with a verb.
